From 352d50b4e95f0fb797d4cebc18a99a2c0460035e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ken Mays <kmays2000@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Apr 2026 13:40:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 03/20] Opensound support

[rations: rebased onto wine-11.21. configure.ac: upstream now uses AC_CHECK_MEMBER, not
AC_CHECK_MEMBERS, for oss_sysinfo.numaudioengines (def2c3df6d3, which dropped the unused
HAVE_OSS_SYSINFO_NUMAUDIOENGINES define); kept that alongside this patch's
audio/soundcard.h header. Nothing in the tree used the dropped define.]
---
 configure.ac               | 6 +++---
 dlls/wineoss.drv/oss.c     | 4 ++++
 dlls/wineoss.drv/ossmidi.c | 4 ++++
 3 files changed, 11 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

